1. coconut + GRPO (main comparison for us, main difference is lack of "variable length" latent reasoning)
    https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.11816v1
2. hybrid latent reasoning(latent state + language token as input via gating)
    https://arxiv.org/pdf/2505.18454v1
    Also introduces HRPO, which uses both latent states + output language token for policy update
3. scalable latent reasoning(3 models in one - NL -> latent, latent -> latent(indefinite loops), latent -> NL)
    https://arxiv.org/pdf/2502.05171
    Also produces visualizations and tips for failed/successful runs
    Uses 4096 GPUs, which is infeasible for us...
